WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.901 --> 00:00:03.236
CLARE ABSHIRE:
It's happened again.

00:00:04.637 --> 00:00:06.306
<i> The bed sheets will go slack.</i>

00:00:10.076 --> 00:00:12.145
<i>Or the shower will keep running.</i>

00:00:12.912 --> 00:00:15.482
And you realize he's gone.

00:00:19.752 --> 00:00:21.321
<i> He's just a pile of clothes.</i>

00:00:22.288 --> 00:00:24.491
♪ (UPLIFTING MUSIC PLAYS) 

00:00:25.591 --> 00:00:26.859
HENRY DETAMBLE:
<i> It's not a superpower.</i>

00:00:27.426 --> 00:00:28.828
It's what's wrong with me.

00:00:29.262 --> 00:00:31.697
<i> I can't keep hold
 of a current moment.</i>

00:00:31.764 --> 00:00:33.266
<i> I just slide off.</i>

00:00:35.935 --> 00:00:37.470
<i> I fall back in time.</i>

00:00:41.974 --> 00:00:43.176
<i> It's not changeable.</i>

00:00:45.177 --> 00:00:48.114
CLARE:<i> When he's gone,
 I wait, and I worry.</i>

00:00:48.481 --> 00:00:51.618
HENRY:<i> I'm always going,
 and... she can't follow.</i>

00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:55.355
<i> I wonder where he is...</i>

00:00:56.189 --> 00:00:57.457
<i> when he is...</i>

00:01:02.795 --> 00:01:03.797
<i> if he's in danger...</i>

00:01:06.799 --> 00:01:09.369
but I married a time traveler.

00:01:09.902 --> 00:01:11.304
It's complicated.

